@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Driver Memulai Perjalanan

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #333333
  ActorBorderColor #333333
  LifeLineBorderColor #777777
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  ParticipantBorderColor #333333
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DatabaseBorderColor #333333
  DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor "Driver" as Driver
participant "Frontend Driver\n(Aplikasi Driver)" as FEDriver
participant "Laravel API" as API
participant "TripController" as TripController
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as DB

Driver -> FEDriver: Menekan tombol mulai perjalanan
FEDriver -> API: POST /planned-trips/start-stop\nplanned_trip_id, mode=1
API -> TripController: startStopPlannedTrip(request)
TripController -> DB: Cari planned trip
DB --> TripController: Data planned trip
TripController -> DB: Validasi driver\nsesuai dengan trip
DB --> TripController: Hasil validasi

alt Driver sesuai dan trip belum dimulai
  TripController -> DB: Update started_at
  DB --> TripController: Status perjalanan tersimpan
  TripController --> API: Response success
  API --> FEDriver: Perjalanan aktif
  FEDriver --> Driver: Tampilkan status perjalanan aktif
else Driver tidak sesuai atau trip tidak valid
  TripController --> API: Response error
  API --> FEDriver: Gagal memulai perjalanan
  FEDriver --> Driver: Tampilkan pesan gagal
end

@enduml
